<p>Because personalized items are made just for you, we generally cannot accept returns or exchanges for a change of mind, incorrect personalization details, or ordering the wrong item. For non-personalized items, eligibility depends on the product and circumstances. Please contact us before sending anything back.</p>

<p>If your order arrives damaged, defective, or different from what you ordered, please <a href="#contact-follow-us">contact us</a> as soon as possible with your order number, a brief description, and clear photos of the item and packaging. After reviewing the issue, we may offer a replacement, refund, or another suitable solution.</p>

<p>Approved refunds are returned to the original payment method. Your bank or payment provider may need additional time to process them. Shipping fees are generally non-refundable unless we made an error or the item arrived damaged or defective.</p>

<p>We're here to help make things right. Please reach out before returning an item so we can find the best solution for your order.</p>
